/*==================================================================================
 * 
 * -------------------
 * Important map notes
 * -------------------
 * 
 * Any juicy effects added upon wakeup, it's important to make sure that these
 * are disabled not only through timers, but ensure that they are cleared inside the
 * function DisableScreenEffects()
 * 
 * This will ensure that all effects are cleared when the player enters the observation
 * tunnel and ensure that we have the correct mood for this and later maps.
 * 
 *==================================================================================*/


